                                                "sense_id": "496c93de-9e98-3343-a775-3eef31780862",
                                                "text": "He was very prompt at getting a new job."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5f1df6b-9bda-4d4a-a243-6d17c52d51c7",
